<section class="pillars">
  <div class="pillars-head">
    <span class="label">/What A Brand Needs</span>
    <h2>Six pillars that carry a brand from idea to impact.</h2>
    <p>Not every brand needs all six at once. We work across them as your brand grows, from first foundation to lasting momentum.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="pillars-grid" data-stagger>
    <div class="pillar reveal-item">
      <span class="pillar-num">01</span>
      <h3 class="pillar-name">Foundation</h3>
      <p class="pillar-desc">The purpose, values, and truth a brand is built on. Everything else stands on this.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="pillar reveal-item">
      <span class="pillar-num">02</span>
      <h3 class="pillar-name">Strategy</h3>
      <p class="pillar-desc">Positioning, narrative, and direction. How the brand competes and why it matters.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="pillar reveal-item">
      <span class="pillar-num">03</span>
      <h3 class="pillar-name">Identity</h3>
      <p class="pillar-desc">The name, voice, and personality that make a brand recognisably itself.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="pillar reveal-item">
      <span class="pillar-num">04</span>
      <h3 class="pillar-name">Design</h3>
      <p class="pillar-desc">The visual system, from logo to typography to art direction, that makes it real.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="pillar reveal-item">
      <span class="pillar-num">05</span>
      <h3 class="pillar-name">Experience</h3>
      <p class="pillar-desc">Every touchpoint, digital and physical, where people meet and remember the brand.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="pillar reveal-item">
      <span class="pillar-num">06</span>
      <h3 class="pillar-name">Growth</h3>
      <p class="pillar-desc">Content, campaigns, and systems that keep the brand moving and expanding.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
